# Adeptus Rainy Day Tracking — Project Context & Change Log

## Overview
This is a Boeing-sponsored capstone project providing a sandbox for simulating radar tracking across scenarios with degradation from weather, ground clutter, targets, or equipment. The simulation is built on MATLAB's Sensor Fusion and Tracking Toolbox.

## Repository Location
```
